                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0a0a0a' fontsize='11' italic='true'>Down</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#0a0a0a' fontsize='11' italic='true'>: the underlying score —</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#0a0a0a' fontsize='11' italic='true'>lower = better.</run>
